OL,3,CProgramme listings for TUE 14 APR
OL,4,G2145FThe Essay: Martin Hayes Turns the
OL,5,     FTune
OL,6,     GIn conversation with Olivia
OL,7,     GO'Leary, Irish fiddle-player
OL,8,     GMartin Hayes recalls playing with
OL,9,     Gthe Tulla Ceili Band, founded in
OL,10,     G1946 and still going, and
OL,11,     Gdemystifies jigs and reels.
OL,12,G2200FNight Tracks
OL,13,     GHannah Peel presents an
OL,14,     Gadventurous, immersive soundtrack
OL,15,     Gfor late-night listening, from
OL,16,     Gclassical to contemporary and
OL,17,     Geverything in between.
OL,18,G2330F'Round Midnight
OL,19,     GTonight on 'Round Midnight, Mark
OL,20,     GLockheart picks another selection
OL,21,     Gfrom his collection and Soweto
OL,22,     Ghas more of the best in jazz.
